WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.535
Video six. Create a company: the name, the
year, the features and the GST details.

00:00:06.735 --> 00:00:11.352
First, Company Creation: the name, the state
and the financial year.

00:00:11.282 --> 00:00:16.632
Then the features, with F11: bill-wise entry,
stock and GST.

00:00:16.562 --> 00:00:21.379
Then the GST details. After that, the company
is ready for your masters.

00:00:21.679 --> 00:00:26.097
A new install has no company. Alt+F3 opens
Select Company.

00:00:26.127 --> 00:00:29.209
Under Actions, Create Company is ready.

00:00:29.239 --> 00:00:32.855
Press Enter. The Company Creation screen
opens.

00:00:33.935 --> 00:00:39.487
Type the name of the company: Navrang Textiles.
Hisaab copies it to the mailing name.

00:00:39.517 --> 00:00:45.266
Type the address. Then the list of states
opens. Type "guj", and Gujarat is selected.

00:00:45.967 --> 00:00:54.584
The state decides the tax: CGST and SGST in Gujarat,
IGST for another state. Then type the pincode.

00:00:55.664 --> 00:00:58.280
Press Enter down to the financial year.

00:00:58.428 --> 00:01:05.513
Hisaab proposes the financial year of today's date: from 1
April 2026. The books begin on the same day.

00:01:05.543 --> 00:01:09.692
Ctrl+A saves the company. Then the features
open by themselves.

00:01:10.772 --> 00:01:16.122
Bill-wise entry and inventory are on already.
Hisaab keeps your bills and your stock.

00:01:16.152 --> 00:01:18.970
On GST, press Y for yes.

00:01:19.352 --> 00:01:25.769
Ctrl+A. Now Hisaab asks for the GST details.
Later, F11 opens these features again.

00:01:26.849 --> 00:01:30.998
The state comes from the company. The
registration type is Regular.

00:01:31.028 --> 00:01:33.846
Type the GSTIN of your company.

00:01:34.545 --> 00:01:39.429
This GSTIN is only an example. Use your own
GSTIN.

00:01:39.459 --> 00:01:42.344
Ctrl+A saves the GST details.

00:01:42.374 --> 00:01:47.993
The Gateway shows your new company. Its year
runs from April 2026 to March 2027.

00:01:48.473 --> 00:01:51.490
Every new company starts with 28 groups.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.906
And two ledgers: Cash, and Profit & Loss A/c.

00:01:55.105 --> 00:01:58.591
Your company is ready. Next: the masters.

